Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=1}========================CHAPTERS AND OPENINGS=====================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:33.75,0:01:35.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, sir?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:35.05,0:01:38.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How did they capture you?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:38.09,0:01:39.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was stupid.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:39.63,0:01:41.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All this time,\NI trusted Kyoshiro,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:41.97,0:01:44.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but he stabbed me in the back.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:48.18,0:01:51.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what the\Nhell happened to the tree?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:51.56,0:01:52.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Mom.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:52.77,0:01:53.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She started throwing\Na fit back in the dome.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.91,0:01:58.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And her attack\Nmade it all the way out here?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.38,0:02:00.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that's terrifying.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.80,0:02:04.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though she did help me escape.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.05,0:02:05.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all these years
Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.59,0:02:10.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Kyoshiro was\None of Oden's retainers.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.85,0:02:12.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.64,0:02:15.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano's history or its future.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.89,0:02:19.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyone who betrays me will pay.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.82,0:02:27.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.16,0:02:37.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You-gara won't take\Nanother step!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.63,0:02:49.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not\Nas tough as they look.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.59,0:02:51.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Butcher them!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.05,0:02:53.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We will not submit!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.10,0:02:55.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not to you-gara, or anyone else!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.93,0:02:58.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.68,0:03:25.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, we will take\Ncare of the rest!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.92,0:03:27.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, we will take\Ncare of the rest!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.93,0:03:28.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.17,0:03:30.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.10,0:03:30.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forget about us?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.47,0:03:34.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forget about us?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.01,0:03:36.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dog! Cat!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.57,0:03:39.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think we deserve a turn first.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.32,0:03:41.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.62,0:04:46.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's more than just\Nthe Straw Hats down there.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.50,0:04:49.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those are definitely\Nprisoners from Udon.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.00,0:04:51.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My prisoners.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.19,0:04:53.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even Hyogoro's here!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.40,0:04:56.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Step away for a sec\Nand it all goes to hell!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.20,0:04:58.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened at the labor camp?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.41,0:05:01.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babanuki wouldn't\Nbetray me, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.50,0:05:03.37,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,395,1,\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}This is the Chief Warden.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.37,0:05:05.63,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,395,1,\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}It seems we finally got through.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.63,0:05:08.17,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,All of our enemies are\Nsitting quietly behind bars.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.17,0:05:10.67,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,That includes Straw Hat Luffy,\NCaptain Kid,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.67,0:05:12.38,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,and all the other rebels.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.38,0:05:16.39,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I just called to let you\Nknow that all is well.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.39,0:05:18.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It just doesn't add up.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.48,0:05:24.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry,\NI won't blame you for this.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.81,0:05:26.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know who you are, after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.73,0:05:28.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're an idiot.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.06,0:05:30.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were doing so well\Ntill you hit the last part!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.11,0:05:32.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your antics aside,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.90,0:05:34.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we need to settle this\Nsituation immediately.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.86,0:05:39.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever.\NStop bossing me around.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.60,0:05:43.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat! Eat shit!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.74,0:05:48.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The island is in chaos\Nfrom top to bottom.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.92,0:05:51.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You only joined\Nthe Beast Pirates
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.42,0:05:54.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because the situation\Nforced you to.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.22,0:05:56.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now's your chance for revenge.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.44,0:05:59.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're telling me\Nto betray Kaido?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.23,0:06:01.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't take me for a fool.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.78,0:06:08.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What have you been\Ntrying so hard to predict?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.08,0:06:11.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The probability that a certain\Nman survives the night.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.96,0:06:15.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just one percent? I pity him.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.00,0:06:22.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me? Tobi Roppo?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.72,0:06:26.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm busy! Ugh!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.80,0:06:28.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you want, King?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.43,0:06:31.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're aware\Nof the current situation.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.81,0:06:34.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It doesn't reflect well on us.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.65,0:06:37.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gathered today\Nfor the Fire Festival,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.15,0:06:38.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but even with\Nall our forces here,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.78,0:06:41.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we still allowed\Nthe samurai to invade.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.57,0:06:45.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is without\Na doubt the biggest error
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.28,0:06:47.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in Onigashima's history.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.99,0:06:50.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We must put aside\Nour internal strife,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.70,0:06:54.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,even if Kaido was the one\Nwho encouraged it.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.08,0:06:55.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.33,0:06:57.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm referring to\Nthe promise he made.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.46,0:06:59.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm sure\Nyou're searching for
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.21,0:07:01.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Young Master Yamato,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.09,0:07:03.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hoping to earn the right\Nto challenge one of
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.01,0:07:06.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Lead Performers\Nfor their position.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.26,0:07:09.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was looking forward\Nto it, myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.30,0:07:12.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we must postpone\Nthat for now.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.14,0:07:13.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? You cheater!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.81,0:07:15.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(501,1053)}– He had no choice.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.52,0:07:18.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look around, Sis. It's madness.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.02,0:07:21.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pay-Pay!\NI was hoping you'd pop up!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.69,0:07:23.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato climbed over\Na wall and got away,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.90,0:07:26.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so I need you to carry me\Non your back and...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.53,0:07:27.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(634,1053)}– No.\N– How dare you!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.78,0:07:29.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you stupid brats.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.91,0:07:32.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Who are you calling a brat?\N– Who are you calling a brat?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.24,0:07:33.50,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't lump me\Ntogether with Ulti!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.71,0:07:37.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Kaido is fighting\Non the rooftop.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.21,0:07:38.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right now, the enemy is trying
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.67,0:07:41.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to reach the top\Nfrom the inside.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.96,0:07:45.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move quickly. Stop them\Ndead in their tracks.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.76,0:07:47.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have 30,000 troops.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.84,0:07:49.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They only have 5,000.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.60,0:07:52.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should be able to\Noverwhelm the enemy.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.43,0:07:55.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't mean\Nyou should underestimate them.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.60,0:07:57.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.90,0:08:00.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.06,0:08:01.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cu-lick.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.32,0:08:04.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Drake!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.90,0:08:07.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can take advantage\Nof this mess.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.24,0:08:09.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.03,0:08:11.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got a plan,\Nbut I can't do it alone.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.28,0:08:13.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? You care\Nto elaborate first?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.49,0:08:17.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have somebody\Nthat I want to kill.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.75,0:08:18.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're taking out Queen.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.17,0:08:21.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get me involved in\Nyour petty little rivalry.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.59,0:08:23.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to\Ndiminish our forces.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.80,0:08:26.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll be much better\Noff without him.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.22,0:08:28.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dunno about this.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.97,0:08:32.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Sir Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.72,0:08:34.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep aiming for the top!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.31,0:08:36.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our men'll clear\Nthe way for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.27,0:08:38.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! So save your strength!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.73,0:08:41.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna\Nneed it soon enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.53,0:08:49.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forward!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.90,0:08:54.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Open up a path\Nfor the Straw Hat Crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.59,0:09:13.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not losing\Nto criminal scum!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.89,0:09:19.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is certainly chaotic.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.06,0:09:26.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta kick that\Nbig boy out of the way!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.60,0:09:29.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hard to believe such\Na thing even exists!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.52,0:09:31.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be intimidated!\NAttack its feet!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.86,0:09:33.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll bring it to the ground!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.83,0:10:43.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, fleabags,\Nyou've had enough fun.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.83,0:10:47.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, fleabags,\Nyou've had enough fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.50,0:10:53.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.81,0:10:56.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jack is one of\Nour Lead Performers.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.64,0:10:58.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I handpicked him myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.98,0:11:01.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You really think\NI'm gonna sit back
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.23,0:11:06.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and watch one of my most\Nvalued men get butchered?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.11,0:11:08.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I failed you, Commander.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.86,0:11:10.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have no excuse.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.75,0:11:12.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take heart, Jack.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.09,0:11:14.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You didn't lose\Nbecause you're weak.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.47,0:11:18.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're just strong.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.47,0:11:24.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Overwhelmingly so.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.44,0:11:31.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their Sulong power has\Ncaused our crew grievous losses.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.74,0:11:34.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But look at them now.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.57,0:11:37.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at how many Minks\Nyou've destroyed.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.32,0:11:42.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get yourself patched up.\NYou've done enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.48,0:11:46.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you know?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.69,0:11:50.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know what you did,\Nso why don't you tell the class?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.03,0:11:58.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For one, back in the capital,\Nyou let Trafalgar Law escape.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.98,0:12:00.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A guard overheard you.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.73,0:12:04.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised it was you,\Nbut I can't determine your goal.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.44,0:12:06.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems so pointless.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.52,0:12:08.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.06,0:12:10.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So when you said you\Nwanted to kill somebody...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.11,0:12:12.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was obviously you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.69,0:12:15.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A shame that one of\Nour head officers was a rat.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.92,0:12:16.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surely you\Ncan't be working alone.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.35,0:12:18.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surely you\Ncan't be working alone.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.76,0:12:18.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must be feeding\Nintel to someone.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.23,0:12:20.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must be feeding\Nintel to someone.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.01,0:12:20.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's your mission?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.48,0:12:21.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's your mission?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.26,0:12:21.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you, really?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.61,0:12:24.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you, really?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.49,0:12:31.20,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,It's over. I can't\Ntalk my way out of this.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.92,0:12:34.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kill me if you want to.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.05,0:12:37.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I will never tell\Nyou bastards the truth!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.48,0:12:39.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't kill you.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.74,0:12:43.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why would I do that, when I\Ncould torture you instead?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.41,0:12:51.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, the fun\Nwe'll have together, Drake!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.55,0:12:55.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's not so big.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.97,0:12:57.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.79,0:13:00.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's as big and mean as Oars.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.05,0:13:01.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That fight wasn't easy!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.84,0:13:06.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In fact, it took all our power\Ncombined to knock him out.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.76,0:13:10.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not this time!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.11,0:13:16.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.77,0:13:21.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.12,0:13:29.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(676.5,1053)}{\fad(150,150)}– ...Calibur!\N– ...Gun!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.16,0:13:35.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! That power!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.33,0:13:35.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He looks just like\Nthe God of Fire himself!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.50,0:13:38.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just like the\NGod of Fire himself!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.05,0:13:44.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.52,0:13:57.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.77,0:14:01.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aww! Here I was hoping\Nyou'd put up a fight.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.48,0:14:03.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's more fun that way.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.60,0:14:06.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.23,0:14:06.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Consider this a parting gift.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.76,0:14:08.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.85,0:14:14.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.44,0:14:23.11,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine. But now what?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.11,0:14:25.24,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't go back to the Navy!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.86,0:14:28.62,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,No! Figure that out later!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.25,0:14:34.21,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't give up.\NThere's still hope.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.88,0:14:46.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way! Juki!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.18,0:14:49.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}X...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.60,0:14:51.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Kong...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.06,0:14:54.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(676.5,1053)}{\fad(150,272)}– ...Calibur!\N– ...Gun!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.01,0:15:11.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on! Seriously?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.40,0:15:20.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.80,0:15:26.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nicely done!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.72,0:15:28.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.97,0:15:31.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Drake, from the Tobi Roppo!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.02,0:15:33.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why's that guy\Nhelping out Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.52,0:15:42.11,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't give up! Not yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.59,0:15:49.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.16,0:15:50.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.12,0:15:50.33,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you,\NLuffy's the best!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.33,0:15:53.37,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you,\NLuffy's the best!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.37,0:15:55.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.50,0:15:59.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't explain now,\Nbut I am an army of one!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.22,0:16:00.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me help!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.46,0:16:00.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me help!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.47,0:16:01.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me fight beside you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.76,0:16:01.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me fight beside you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.93,0:16:03.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not your enemy!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.22,0:16:06.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not your enemy!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.98,0:16:14.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.72,0:16:22.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.27,0:16:24.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems kind of suspect.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.44,0:16:26.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why the sudden\Nchange of heart, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.31,0:16:29.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not to mention\Nthis guy's a perv.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.65,0:16:32.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This creep spied on Nami\Nand Robin taking a bath
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.32,0:16:33.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,back in the Flower Capital!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.99,0:16:35.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait. What happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.62,0:16:37.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like he\Nbecame half-dinosaur.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.62,0:16:41.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems to be a signature power\Namong the Tobi Roppo.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.83,0:16:45.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But something isn't right.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.42,0:16:47.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Has he lost his frickin' mind?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.59,0:16:49.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Drake! What gives?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.50,0:16:51.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did you attack\None of the Numbers?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.10,0:16:52.18,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you,\NLuffy's the best!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.18,0:16:55.39,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you,\NLuffy's the best!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.22,0:16:58.10,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know\Nexactly how to put it.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.10,0:16:59.85,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like, if he's your friend,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.85,0:17:01.94,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,he feels closer than\Nanything in the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.94,0:17:04.40,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,But if he's your enemy,\Nhe's totally out of reach!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.40,0:17:05.90,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,He's more than a pirate.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.90,0:17:07.94,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no one else like him!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.94,0:17:11.28,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.28,0:17:12.70,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,There's just\Nsomething about him!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.70,0:17:14.99,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,He has this power\Nthat draws everyone in!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.44,0:17:20.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think I know you!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.24,0:17:22.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do you wanna\Ntake down Kaido?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.36,0:17:24.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you why,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.33,0:17:26.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I assure you\Nour goals align.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.03,0:17:35.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever you want from us,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.41,0:17:37.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we're too late in the game\Nto deal with this crap!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.34,0:17:39.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.66,0:17:41.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know what he's done, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.08,0:17:41.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This guy is Kaido's lackey,\Njust like Hawkins!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.82,0:17:44.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Just like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.17,0:17:49.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen! I left that position,\Nand they want me dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.42,0:17:52.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, so now you want\Nour protection?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.34,0:17:53.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't want backstabbers
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.55,0:17:55.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,anywhere near my captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.64,0:17:59.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy doesn't need\Nyour help, so stay away.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.48,0:18:04.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even among fellow pirates,\Nthere's still a code of honor!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.89,0:18:10.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky? Jinbe?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.30,0:18:28.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, Drake. You can help.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.85,0:18:30.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Luffy, no!\N– Luffy, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.35,0:18:33.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know you're the captain,\Nbut stay the hell outta this!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.71,0:18:38.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't really blame you!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.60,0:18:38.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must get to the roof,\NLuffy! Now hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.60,0:18:41.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must get to the roof,\NLuffy! Now, hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.73,0:18:41.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys. I'm on it!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.73,0:18:44.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys. I'm on it!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.47,0:18:47.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji. Let's make it\Nto the big battle!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.68,0:18:50.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji. Let's make it\Nto the big battle!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.26,0:18:50.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.43,0:18:51.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.05,0:18:52.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think I\Nfigured out who's in charge
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.88,0:18:54.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of all the samurai and pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.72,0:18:56.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's that straw hat guy\Nfrom before!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.88,0:18:58.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go after him.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.52,0:18:59.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's help Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.77,0:19:01.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do whatever you can\Nto hold them back!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.40,0:19:06.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get out of our way,\Nif you know what's good for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.03,0:19:08.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna smash you
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.49,0:19:27.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know those two jerks.\NI fought them earlier!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.53,0:19:29.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(524,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.66,0:19:37.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the dinosaur guy\Nfrom the capital.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.87,0:19:42.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on. Who's that\Nultra-cutie there with him?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.59,0:19:49.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll see to it you\Ndon't get anywhere near Kaido!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.13,0:19:51.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This ends now, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.44,0:19:55.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Special Attack! Green Star, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.98,0:20:02.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Wait for it. Skull-Bomb Grass!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.24,0:20:10.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pay-Pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.75,0:20:17.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who's there? Answer me!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.63,0:20:22.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's me! Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.72,0:20:24.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell\Nis wrong with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.55,0:20:27.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I love\Nmore than stomping lizards!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.72,0:20:30.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. I hope you're ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.14,0:20:33.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Cut that out, you idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.39,0:20:37.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you call me a lizard?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.27,0:20:38.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay where you are!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.44,0:20:41.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unless you wanna be\Ndoused in repticide!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.11,0:20:43.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't hide behind me!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.65,0:20:46.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you shoot me!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.36,0:20:49.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which one of you\Ndid it? Fess up!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.74,0:20:51.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Over here, Pay-Pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.03,0:20:53.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was that\Nscrawny little tramp!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.66,0:20:56.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's right!\NYou've met your match!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.04,0:20:58.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For I'm the Great\NLizard Buster Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.38,0:21:00.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Better rember my name!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.13,0:21:02.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you! Enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.45,0:21:06.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That wasn't me\Ntalking, but it doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.55,0:21:10.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're already knee deep\Nin this fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.33,0:21:12.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine! I'm not scared!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.85,0:21:14.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show me the worst you can do!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.83,0:21:16.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.81,0:21:22.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y'know, your words don't\Nmatch your actions at all!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.44,0:21:23.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like you're one to talk!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.98,0:21:26.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.32,0:21:28.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're in it deep\Nfor hurting Pay-Pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.24,0:21:29.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're outta here!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.32,0:21:30.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,G-Good Bye!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.36,0:21:33.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– You'll never take us alive!\N– You'll never take us alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.16,0:21:35.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Stop running!\N– Stop running!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.20,0:21:40.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Wait!\N– Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.54,0:21:44.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Usopp!\NYou better protect Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.38,0:21:47.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, let's go.\NKinemon's waiting for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.66,0:21:50.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.83,0:21:59.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta\Ncover your ears, Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.39,0:22:00.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. All right!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.90,0:22:04.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm about to drop\Nsome Fighting Music! Slash!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.80,0:22:15.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Learned from last time,\Nhuh? Aren't you clever!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.22,0:22:20.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you know, you're about\Nto be in for a bad time!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.76,0:22:23.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You kinda need that sense\Nof hearing to fight, boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.89,0:22:26.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,234)}Check it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.54,0:23:10.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goki!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.13,0:23:12.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Juki!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.43,0:23:14.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's bumming me out
Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.64,0:23:17.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to see you guys\Nlike this right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.26,0:23:21.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon. What the hell\Nhappened here, man?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.06,0:23:22.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There was a time\Nwhen the ten of you
Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.64,0:23:27.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,wrecked cities like\Nit weren't no thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.40,0:23:31.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This pisses me off.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.94,0:23:33.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those weak-sauce\Nbuzz-kills think
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.90,0:23:35.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they can roll up to our party
Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.28,0:23:36.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and clobber the piss\Nout of you guys,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.87,0:23:38.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just 'cause you're wasted?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.24,0:23:40.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the ultimate diss!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.83,0:23:47.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haccha, haccha.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.05,0:23:53.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right. It's time to party.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.84,0:23:55.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haccha!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.80,0:23:58.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haccha.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:00.18,0:24:03.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you sobered up yet?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.81,0:24:08.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's ten of these guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.73,0:24:11.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I gotta score some more cola!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.11,0:24:13.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With a name like the "Numbers,"\NI should've known.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.90,0:24:15.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, Ancient Giant,\Nit's time to go.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.70,0:24:18.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show 'em what happens\Nwhen you get in the flow!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.20,0:24:20.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fe, to the Fi,\Nto the Fo, to the Fum.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.24,0:24:22.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it up, give it up!\NLet's get dumb!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.00,0:24:27.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell? Is he able\Nto command those guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.75,0:24:29.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's so annoying!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.17,0:24:31.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just ditch them!\NThere's no time for this!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.38,0:24:34.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have a point. Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.41,0:24:36.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.68,0:24:43.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't jack my freestyle.\NYou're in denial! Ya-yow!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.02,0:24:44.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haccha gonna make you\Nrun eight miles.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.89,0:24:47.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it up, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:47.52,0:24:49.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's keep ignoring this idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.15,0:24:50.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Sounds like a plan!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.68,0:25:19.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at how strong he is!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.43,0:25:22.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Careful! If he swings him\Naround, we're surely done for!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.31,0:25:24.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, this is just great.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.19,0:25:32.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.35,0:25:36.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen here.\NRun straight out of the dome
Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.36,0:25:38.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as fast as your legs\Nwill take you!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:39.82,0:25:41.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we allow that\Ngiant to run wild,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.95,0:25:45.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then the samurai won't make it\Nto the final skirmish!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.16,0:25:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm on it!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.62,0:25:47.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do your best!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.03,0:25:51.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Always do!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.92,0:25:56.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,General Franky is not\Nyour personal plaything,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.72,0:25:58.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you big goon!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.01,0:26:04.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And good luck\Ntrying to catch me!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:07.63,0:26:09.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,858)\i1}Damn! No respect, I tell you!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.73,0:26:14.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll show him I'm\Nnot some dumb toy!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.48,0:26:17.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At least hear me out!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.86,0:26:20.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have a lot to gain\Nfrom your victory!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.16,0:26:23.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My life depends on it!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.49,0:26:25.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can I convince you?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.79,0:26:37.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I gotta admit, you seem\Nlike an honest guy. But...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.26,0:26:40.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There won't be an alliance\Ntill I figure out
Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.96,0:26:42.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.18,0:26:43.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,what makes you tick!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:43.68,0:26:47.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you, what do you want,\Nand who do you work for?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.43,0:26:55.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rise up! Bring the party\Nto the scene!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:55.77,0:26:58.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crank it! Numbers gonna\Nmake you scream!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.52,0:26:59.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on out.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:59.90,0:27:03.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo? I need your help!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.15,0:27:04.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sobered up yet?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.22,0:27:11.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You better knock that shit off!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.24,0:27:18.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard some interesting\Nrumors 'bout you, homie.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:18.98,0:27:20.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me guess,\Nyou're out of options,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.61,0:27:23.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so you're leeching off\Nthat weak little pirate crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.64,0:27:26.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never liked you, Apoo.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:26.73,0:27:30.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for an\Nexcuse to kick your ass!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:30.36,0:27:33.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't a favor for\NStraw Hat. I just hate that guy.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:33.46,0:27:36.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got one thing\Nin common, at least.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:36.63,0:27:40.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got a score to settle\Nwith this clown, myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:42.32,0:27:46.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine, I give in!\NIt's an alliance!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:46.03,0:27:47.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:07.90,0:28:12.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Drakey!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:13.70,0:28:17.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now I got you\Nright where I want you,
Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.07,0:28:19.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you traitorous turd!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:19.41,0:28:21.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you're more than a traitor.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:21.87,0:28:23.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a spy.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:23.79,0:28:26.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmph. You're pretty popular.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:26.16,0:28:28.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure you want to\Nteam up with Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:28.17,0:28:30.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha. I never wanted\Nthem as friends,
Dialogue: 50,0:28:30.17,0:28:32.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so I'm happy to\Nhave them as enemies.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.17,0:28:33.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:33.92,0:28:35.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! You gotta stay with me!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:35.92,0:28:36.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm trying!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.97,0:28:39.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's too much! Just leave me!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:39.14,0:28:41.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll be fine! It's not bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.85,0:28:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.\NIt burns!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:34.91,0:29:35.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's see how long you can
Dialogue: 50,0:29:35.08,0:29:36.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's see how long you can
Dialogue: 50,0:29:36.25,0:29:36.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,survive my attacks, shall we?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:36.41,0:29:39.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,survive my attacks, shall we?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:41.67,0:29:42.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One shot and you're dead,\Nso I'd start running!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:42.25,0:29:46.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One shot and you're\Ndead, so I'd start running!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:51.43,0:29:54.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The thought of escape\Nnever occurred to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:54.22,0:29:56.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Blast Breath!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:58.40,0:30:00.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Foxfire Style!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:04.23,0:30:06.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}Flame-Rend!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:34.68,0:30:37.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You thought we'd run?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:37.02,0:30:39.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you take us for?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.48,0:30:42.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No more! We're done fleeing!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:42.11,0:30:44.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The time to fight is now!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:44.57,0:30:47.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We stand here as\NLord Oden's samurai,
Dialogue: 50,0:30:47.40,0:30:50.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and we shall\Nproudly die as such!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.66,0:30:55.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After relieving you\Nof your head, that is!
